{"id":1623,"date":"2026-08-23T22:48:45","date_gmt":"2026-08-23T22:48:45","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=1623"},"modified":"2026-08-23T23:47:07","modified_gmt":"2026-08-23T23:47:07","slug":"export-as-html","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/export-share\/export-as-html\/","title":{"rendered":"Export as HTML"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Export as HTML<\/span><\/h2>\n<h2 class=\"western\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1626\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/HTML-Export.jpg\" alt=\"Export as HTML\" width=\"468\" height=\"339\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/HTML-Export.jpg 1278w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/HTML-Export-300x217.jpg 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/HTML-Export-1024x741.jpg 1024w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/HTML-Export-768x556.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 468px) 100vw, 468px\" \/><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">The Export as HTML feature turns your Open Publisher document into a standalone <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">.html<\/span> file for use as an email newsletter, a mobile-responsive flyer, or a web page. An Advanced HTML Export modal gives you full control over exactly how the file is generated.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">How to Export as HTML<\/span><\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Go to <strong>File &gt; Save as HTML<\/strong>.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">The <strong>Advanced HTML Export<\/strong> modal opens. Choose your export options (see below).<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Click <strong>Generate HTML File<\/strong> to download the result.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Export Options<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1634\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ExportOptionsBanner.webp\" alt=\"Export Options\" width=\"199\" height=\"163\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ExportOptionsBanner.webp 715w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ExportOptionsBanner-300x246.webp 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 199px) 100vw, 199px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-1636\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ExportOptionsSNL.webp\" alt=\"Seamless Newsletter Layout\" width=\"55\" height=\"49\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ExportOptionsSNL.webp 320w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ExportOptionsSNL-300x268.webp 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 55px) 100vw, 55px\" \/>Seamless Newsletter Layout &#8211;<\/strong> Removes margins and shadows between pages for a single unified scrolling canvas.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-1641\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ExportOptionsOEC.webp\" alt=\"Optimise for Email Clients\" width=\"54\" height=\"51\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ExportOptionsOEC.webp 306w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ExportOptionsOEC-300x278.webp 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 54px) 100vw, 54px\" \/>Optimise for Email Clients &#8211;<\/strong> Converts all pages to high-fidelity screenshots wrapped in a legacy <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">&lt;table&gt;<\/span> structure, ensuring 100% layout compatibility with strict email clients such as Gmail, Outlook, and Mailchimp, where modern CSS often fails.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-1644\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ExportOptionsEEI.webp\" alt=\"Embed External Images (Single-File\" width=\"52\" height=\"48\" \/> \u00a0 Embed External Images (Single-File) &#8211;<\/strong> Converts all remote images (such as Clipart) into inline Base64 Data URIs, so the <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">.html<\/span> file works completely offline without broken image links.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-1647\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ExportOptionsASF.webp\" alt=\"Auto-Scale to Fit Screen\" width=\"55\" height=\"48\" \/>Auto-Scale to Fit Screen &#8211;<\/strong> Injects a dynamic CSS <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">transform: scale()<\/span> rule so fixed-width flyer layouts shrink correctly onto small mobile screens.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-1650\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ExportOptionsETS.webp\" alt=\"Enable Text Selection \/ Copying\" width=\"54\" height=\"45\" \/> Enable Text Selection \/ Copying &#8211;<\/strong> Controls whether viewers are able to highlight and copy text from the exported HTML page.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-1658\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ExportOptionsSEO.webp\" alt=\"Inject SEO &amp; Social Meta Tags\" width=\"55\" height=\"49\" \/>Inject SEO &amp; Social Meta Tags &#8211;<\/strong> Runs a headless analysis of your document&#8217;s text, extracts the top 5 keywords, formulates a 150-character description, and injects <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">og:title<\/span>, <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">og:description<\/span>, and standard meta tags into the <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">&lt;head&gt;<\/span> &#8211; generating correct preview cards when shared on iMessage, Twitter, and Facebook.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-1660\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ExportOptionsMHT.webp\" alt=\"Minify HTML\" width=\"55\" height=\"46\" \/>Minify HTML &#8211;<\/strong> Strips away as much of the whitespace left behind as possible from the raw HTML so that the final file size is much more reduced.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-1664\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ExportOptionsIGF.webp\" alt=\"Include Google Fonts\" width=\"55\" height=\"45\" \/>Include Google Fonts &#8211;<\/strong> Appends <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">&lt;link&gt;<\/span> tags for all fonts used in the document, preserving your typography correctly in the browser.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Export as HTML The Export as HTML feature turns your Open Publisher document into a standalone .html file for use as an email newsletter, a mobile-responsive flyer, or a web page. An Advanced HTML Export modal gives you full control over exactly how the file is generated. How to Export as HTML Go to File [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":1669,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[21],"class_list":["post-1623","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-export-share"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1623","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/knowledgebase"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1623"}],"version-history":[{"count":33,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1623\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1668,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1623\/revisions\/1668"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/1669"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1623"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"knowledgebase_cat","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase_cat?post=1623"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}